<title>USA: GST NACT unit files to offer common shares.</title>
<headline>GST NACT unit files to offer common shares.</headline>
<dateline>OREM, Utah 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>NACT Telecommunications Inc said Wednesday it has filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission to make an underwritten intial public offering.</p>
<p>NACT, a unit of Vancouver, Washington-based GST Telecommunications Inc, said it would sell two million common shares and another million would be sold by a stockholder.</p>
<p>NACT provides advanced telecommunications switching platforms with integrated applications software and network telemanagement capabilities.</p>
</text>
